{"seq":1,"slug":"fx-exposure-hedge-policy","title":"资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/fx-exposure-hedge-policy","wordCount":2046,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略\">资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略</h1><p>多币种资金池有一个绕不开的副作用：归集之后，集团持有的是<strong>折算后的一个总头寸</strong>，但真实的资金分散在多个币种里。汇率一动，折算出来的总头寸就变了，而集团的债务、采购、分红可能恰好以另一个币种计价。这就是外汇敞口——司库无法通过归集消除的风险，只能通过识别、计量与对冲来管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>外汇敞口分三类，管理方式完全不同：</p>\n<p><strong>交易敞口（transaction exposure）</strong> 来自已签合同但尚未结算的外币现金流。已确认的外币应收应付、已承诺的采购、已排定的外币利息，都会因汇率变动而改变本币金额。</p>\n<p><strong>折算敞口（translation exposure）</strong> 来自境外子公司的报表折算。子公司的功能货币与集团列报货币不同时，其资产、负债、损益折算进合并报表会产生汇率差额。国际准则对这一层的核心定义是：功能货币是&quot;主体经营所处的主要经济环境中的货币&quot;，即它<strong>主要产生和支出现金</strong>的环境；除此以外的都是外币（见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-21-the-effects-of-changes-in-foreign-exchange-rates/\">IFRS Foundation 对 IAS 21 的说明</a>）。折算敞口通常进入其他综合收益，而非当期损益。</p>\n<p><strong>经济敞口（economic exposure）</strong> 来自长期竞争力受汇率影响，如本币升值削弱出口竞争力。它无法用金融工具对冲，只能通过经营结构调整应对。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[外币敞口来源] --&gt; B[交易敞口 已签合同]&#10;    A --&gt; C[折算敞口 子公司报表]&#10;    A --&gt; D[经济敞口 长期竞争力]&#10;    B --&gt; E[可精确计量]&#10;    C --&gt; F[按会计准则计量]&#10;    D --&gt; G[难精确计量]&#10;    E --&gt; H[金融工具对冲 远期/掉期/期权]&#10;    F --&gt; I[资产负债对冲 或 净投资对冲]&#10;    G --&gt; J[经营结构调整]\">graph TD\n    A[外币敞口来源] --&gt; B[交易敞口 已签合同]\n    A --&gt; C[折算敞口 子公司报表]\n    A --&gt; D[经济敞口 长期竞争力]\n    B --&gt; E[可精确计量]\n    C --&gt; F[按会计准则计量]\n    D --&gt; G[难精确计量]\n    E --&gt; H[金融工具对冲 远期/掉期/期权]\n    F --&gt; I[资产负债对冲 或 净投资对冲]\n    G --&gt; J[经营结构调整]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>敞口类型</th>\n<th>计量基础</th>\n<th>常见对冲工具</th>\n<th>会计处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易敞口</td>\n<td>已签合同外币现金流</td>\n<td>远期、外汇掉期、期权</td>\n<td>公允价值或现金流量对冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折算敞口</td>\n<td>境外净投资</td>\n<td>外币借款、净投资对冲</td>\n<td>其他综合收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济敞口</td>\n<td>情景分析</td>\n<td>无直接工具</td>\n<td>经营调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"敞口的计量\">敞口的计量</h2><h3 id=\"净敞口而非毛敞口\">净敞口而非毛敞口</h3><p>计量的第一步是<strong>按币种轧差</strong>。同一币种下的应收与应付、资产与负债可以自然对冲，只有净额才是需要对冲的部分。资金池在这里提供了天然优势：归集后同一币种的正负头寸已经合并，净敞口一目了然。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>A</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E*c = \\sum_i A*{i,c} - \\sum*i L*{i,c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为币种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的净敞口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 分别为该币种的资产与负债。需要注意的是，只有<strong>同期限、同确定性</strong>的项目相互对冲才有效——三个月后确定收到的美元应收，不能完全对冲明天可能需要支付的美元。因此敞口表应按时间桶分列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"敞口表的构建\">敞口表的构建</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH exposure AS (&#10;  SELECT currency,&#10;         bucket,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;receivable&#39; THEN amount_local ELSE 0 END)&#10;       - SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;payable&#39;    THEN amount_local ELSE 0 END)&#10;       + SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;cash&#39;       THEN amount_local ELSE 0 END)&#10;       - SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;debt&#39;       THEN amount_local ELSE 0 END)&#10;                                                     AS net_exposure_local,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;receivable&#39; THEN amount_base ELSE 0 END)&#10;       - SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;payable&#39;    THEN amount_base ELSE 0 END)&#10;       + SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;cash&#39;       THEN amount_base ELSE 0 END)&#10;       - SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;debt&#39;       THEN amount_base ELSE 0 END)&#10;                                                     AS net_exposure_base,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN item_type = &#39;forecast&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS has_forecast_items&#10;  FROM fx_exposure_item&#10;  WHERE as_of = DATE &#39;2026-09-28&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY currency, bucket&#10;)&#10;SELECT currency, bucket,&#10;       ROUND(net_exposure_local, 2) AS net_exposure_local,&#10;       ROUND(net_exposure_base, 2)  AS net_exposure_base,&#10;       CASE WHEN has_forecast_items &gt; 0 THEN &#39;mixed_confidence&#39; ELSE &#39;contracted&#39; END&#10;                                    AS confidence&#10;FROM exposure&#10;WHERE ABS(net_exposure_base) &gt; 10000&#10;ORDER BY ABS(net_exposure_base) DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exposure </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'receivable'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_local </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payable'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_local </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cash'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_local </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'debt'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_local </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                     AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_exposure_local,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'receivable'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payable'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cash'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'debt'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount_base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                     AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_exposure_base,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'forecast'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_forecast_items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fx_exposure_item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> as_of </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-28'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency, bucket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency, bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_exposure_local, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_exposure_local,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_exposure_base, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_exposure_base,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_forecast_items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mixed_confidence'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'contracted'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> confidence</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exposure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_exposure_base) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(net_exposure_base) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>confidence</code> 字段区分了已签合同项与预测项——对冲已签合同项与对冲预测项的策略应该不同，前者可以按名义金额全额对冲，后者通常只对冲一部分比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对冲工具与决策\">对冲工具与决策</h2><h3 id=\"远期与掉期的取舍\">远期与掉期的取舍</h3><p><strong>外汇远期</strong>是最基本的工具：锁定未来某日某币种的兑换汇率，消除不确定性。它的缺点是无法享受有利的汇率变动——市场朝有利方向走时，远期合约会产生等额的反向损益。</p>\n<p><strong>外汇掉期</strong>用于同时管理的近端与远端：例如现在需要把欧元换成美元使用，但一个月后会有美元流入需要换回欧元，用一笔掉期即可完成，成本是掉期点数而非两次独立交易的点差。</p>\n<p><strong>期权</strong>保留上行收益但需要支付权利金。对司库而言，期权的价值在于应对<strong>不确定性高的敞口</strong>——如果未来外币现金流的金额或时间不确定（可能中标也可能不中标），远期会有过度对冲的风险，期权则可以在不发生时放弃行权。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>消除不确定性</th>\n<th>保留有利变动</th>\n<th>成本形式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>远期</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>远期点差</td>\n<td>金额与时间确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掉期</td>\n<td>完全（近远端）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>掉期点数</td>\n<td>双向资金流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期权</td>\n<td>部分（保底）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>权利金</td>\n<td>金额或时间不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货币互换</td>\n<td>完全（含利息）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>利差</td>\n<td>长期外币债务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"对冲比例的确定\">对冲比例的确定</h3><p>对冲不是&quot;全对或全不对&quot;。对冲比例（hedge ratio）的确定通常分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>敞口确定性</th>\n<th>典型对冲比例</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已签合同、金额时间确定</td>\n<td>80%–100%</td>\n<td>高度确定，对冲成本可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高度可能发生的预测项</td>\n<td>50%–80%</td>\n<td>兼顾成本与灵活性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般预测项</td>\n<td>0%–50%</td>\n<td>不确定性高，全额对冲会过度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>或有项（如投标）</td>\n<td>用期权而非远期</td>\n<td>保留放弃的权利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对冲比例的确定依据是<strong>对冲成本与残留风险的权衡</strong>：对冲不足留下的风险是汇率波动，对冲过度留下的风险是&quot;过度对冲后反向的损益&quot;。后者在会计上可能无法适用对冲会计，导致衍生品公允价值变动直接进损益而对冲项目仍按历史汇率——这种不对称是财务报表波动的常见来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对冲会计的适用条件\">对冲会计的适用条件</h3><p>如果一个对冲工具不被指定为对冲会计，其公允价值变动直接进当期损益；而被对冲项目（如外币应收）在结算前按历史汇率计量，损益尚未确认。这会造成损益表上的&quot;虚假波动&quot;。国际准则为这种情况提供了专门章节：IFRS 9 在 2013 年 11 月新增了对冲会计章节，并且允许主体<strong>作为会计政策选择</strong>，在 IFRS 9 的对冲会计要求与 IAS 39 的原有要求之间择一适用（见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ifrs-9-financial-instruments/\">IFRS Foundation 对 IFRS 9 的说明</a>）。具体适用条件由所选准则章节给出。工程上的含义是：<strong>对冲工具的指定必须在对冲开始时完成，且要有书面文档记录对冲关系、风险目标与被对冲项目</strong>，事后补文档无效——这一点在 IFRS 9 与 IAS 39 之下是一致的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理与政策\">治理与政策</h2><h3 id=\"对冲政策的核心条款\">对冲政策的核心条款</h3><p>对冲政策应当明确写下：可对冲的敞口类型、各确定性层的对冲比例上限、允许的工具清单、单笔与总额度上限、需报批的例外情形、执行与复核的职责分离。政策中最容易被忽略但最重要的条款是<strong>禁止投机</strong>——所有对冲工具必须对应真实的敞口，任何无敞口支撑的衍生品交易都是投机。这一条需要在系统中强制：对冲交易必须关联到具体的敞口记录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与预测和应急的衔接\">与预测和应急的衔接</h3><p>敞口对冲的输入是<a href=\"../position-netting-liquidity/cash-flow-forecast-visibility\">跨主体现金流预测与可视性</a>中的外币现金流预测——预测越不准，可对冲的确定性部分越少。而敞口的极端情景（汇率大幅波动）是流动性风险的组成部分，见<a href=\"liquidity-risk-contingency\">流动性风险与应急额度</a>。三者构成风险管理的闭环：预测给出敞口、敞口驱动对冲、极端情景驱动应急准备。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>外汇敞口分交易、折算、经济三类，只有前两类可用金融工具对冲。</li>\n<li>敞口计量的第一步是按币种轧差，且必须按时间桶分列——同期限同确定性才可互相抵消。</li>\n<li>敞口表须区分已签合同项与预测项，两者适用的对冲策略不同。</li>\n<li>远期消除不确定性但放弃有利变动，掉期处理双向流动，期权适合金额或时间不确定的敞口。</li>\n<li>对冲比例按敞口确定性分层，过度对冲的残留风险与对冲不足同等重要。</li>\n<li>对冲会计需在对冲开始时指定并留有书面文档，事后补文档无效。</li>\n<li>对冲政策必须禁止投机，且系统应强制对冲交易关联到具体敞口记录。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略","id":"资金头寸外汇敞口与对冲策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"敞口的计量","id":"敞口的计量"},{"level":3,"text":"净敞口而非毛敞口","id":"净敞口而非毛敞口"},{"level":3,"text":"敞口表的构建","id":"敞口表的构建"},{"level":2,"text":"对冲工具与决策","id":"对冲工具与决策"},{"level":3,"text":"远期与掉期的取舍","id":"远期与掉期的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"对冲比例的确定","id":"对冲比例的确定"},{"level":3,"text":"对冲会计的适用条件","id":"对冲会计的适用条件"},{"level":2,"text":"治理与政策","id":"治理与政策"},{"level":3,"text":"对冲政策的核心条款","id":"对冲政策的核心条款"},{"level":3,"text":"与预测和应急的衔接","id":"与预测和应急的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"银行账户体系与签约行/签字权管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/bank-account-signatory-structure"},"next":{"title":"流动性风险与应急额度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/treasury-risk-metric/liquidity-risk-contingency"}}